Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 14:51:23 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1176/1259] HERESY 1167: the take card leads back to the
 Librarian; the column pins a take into its own strip; the engine unloads idle
 models by itself; a tip after a click no longer stays
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor, 06.10.2026:
· «Играет трек в плеере. Жму на мигалку, открывает в Творце "медицинскую карту". А как обратно из неё перейти в
  Библиотеку на этот же трек?… У меня полторы тысячи треков сейчас, и я потерялся»: an icon beside ☆ ✎ 🗑 on the take's
  card: the Librarian opens with the take in sight, flashed (the column's menu had it, the card had not);
· «в Takes на мышечное меню.... `Pin in it's (sub)workspace` добавить, если лимит по пинам не достигнут. У нас четыре пина на
  воркспейс»: Pin in “…” in the rooms' column: the workspace in hand when the take is in it, else its section under it,
  else its first own (never frozen, never Sourced for Regeneration); offered while the strip has room; Unpin when pinned;
· «таймер вбить для `Models auto unload`. Дефолт 60 минут. И в Engine ползунок от 15 минут до 4 часов, с инкрементом в 15
  минут. И чекбокс - мгновенная выгрузка моделей (15 секунд grace)»: two engine settings (unload_after_min 15..240 by 15,
  60 by default; unload_at_once, 15 s); the worker looks every 5 s while idle, between jobs only, once per idle spell, and
  frees the models and the cache; Engine's Compute card has the slider and the check;
· «Попап переключения режима темы не исчезает, только если где-то кликнуть»: my slip of this morning: «a focused one stays»
  kept the tip of every button clicked with the mouse (Chrome focuses it); now only a tip reached by the keyboard is
  kept, and a press of the mouse puts the tip away.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
